      "id": "CVE-2026-110923",
      "publishedDate": "2026-10-15T05:24:59.657Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-10-15T11:48:58.318Z",
      "description": "A flaw was found in OpenSSH. During an sftp copy, a malicious server can supply an empty name, a slash-only path, or a \"..\" basename that sftp uses as the local destination, writing outside the directory the user selected.",
      "severity": 6.5,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Red Hat Red Hat Enterprise Linux 10\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
